## 🚀 Getting Started

1. Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/ai-linkedin-profile-optimizer.git
```

2. Navigate to the project folder

```bash
cd ai-linkedin-profile-optimizer
```

3. Open `index.html` in your browser.

No installation required.

---

## 💡 How It Works

1. Enter your LinkedIn information.
2. Receive an AI-powered recruiter-style profile review.
3. Get personalized profile improvements.
4. Compare your before and after profile scores.
5. Follow the generated 7-day LinkedIn growth plan.
6. Export or print your optimized profile report.

